WEBVTT

00:11:27.812 --> 00:11:31.231
Ta denarnica je tudi opomin, da stvari, 
o katerih razmišljate

00:11:31.231 --> 00:11:34.773
v svoji pisarni ali knjižnici,

00:11:34.773 --> 00:11:37.176
niso take, kot jih v resnici izkusite,

00:11:37.176 --> 00:11:38.683
ko stopite v svet.

00:11:38.683 --> 00:11:40.671
Hvala. (Aplavz)

00:11:40.671 --> 00:11:47.343
(Aplavz)

00:11:47.343 --> 00:11:49.412
Chris Anderson: Hvala, Leslie, za pogled,

00:11:49.412 --> 00:11:52.009
ki ga mnogi prej nismo poznali.

00:11:52.009 --> 00:11:55.496
A nekaj me zanima. Če bi imela minuto

00:11:55.496 --> 00:11:59.217
z vodjo proizvodnje pri Applu,

00:11:59.217 --> 00:12:01.577
kaj bi mu dejala?